[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17161.59, "timestamp": "04:46:01", "text": "？ 是不是只有我感觉错了，还是霍基"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17168.15, "timestamp": "04:46:08", "text": "进攻时我死亡的次数比"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17171.23, "timestamp": "04:46:11", "text": "防守时多。 那他妈是什么玩意儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17174.15, "timestamp": "04:46:14", "text": "？ 我应该换吗？ 哦，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17176.31, "timestamp": "04:46:16", "text": "想我应该换的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17184.83, "timestamp": "04:46:24", "text": "拉屎。 为什么我这次能得6分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17187.67, "timestamp": "04:46:27", "text": "？ 哇，那真是一场酣畅淋漓的胜利！   我勒个去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17205.99, "timestamp": "04:46:45", "text": "我的天哪。 天哪，太令人难过了。 那真是个令人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17208.15, "timestamp": "04:46:48", "text": "痛心的损失。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17210.948, "timestamp": "04:46:50", "text": "为什么我遇到的对手竟然是天界高手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17212.708, "timestamp": "04:46:52", "text": "？ 你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17215.99, "timestamp": "04:46:55", "text": "今天想成为哪位英雄？ 那个金色徽章表示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17217.628, "timestamp": "04:46:57", "text": "敌方队伍是"}]